als 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nFor the ten thousands place: 0 + 7 plus the carried-over 1 equals 8. I'll write down 8.\n\nIn the hundred thousands place: 7 + 5 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nFor the millions place: 3 + 3 plus the carried-over 1 equals 7. I'll write down 7.\n\nIn the ten millions place: 4 + 9 equals 13. I'll write down 3 and carry over 1.\n\nFor the hundred millions place: 9 + 2 plus the carried-over 1 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nIn the billions place: 6 + 3 plus the carried-over 1 equals 10. I'll write down 0 and carry over 1.\n\nFinally, in the ten billions place: 9 + 7 plus the carried-over 1 equals 17. I'll write down 17.\n\nCombining all the digits, the final sum is 1,708,237,336,788.\n"]]
